t counted if there exists multiple tiles to complete a winning pattern.\n        * Single Wait: The winning tile must be the tile to complete a pair. This pattern is not counted if there exists multiple tiles to complete a winning pattern.\n        * Self Drawn: The winning tile must be drawn by the winner.\n    Now is your turn, to your best ability, please briefly evaluate a few proimsing moves, provide reason for your final choice, and output one of the valid actions with specified format, such as Play B5.\n        Your response format should be exactly:\n        Evaluation: [Your Evaluation]\n        Reason: [Your Reason]\n        Answer: [Your Answer]\n    ", "user_prompt": "The following is the state information: The Prevailing Wind is: South Wind.Your Seat Wind is: East Wind.\nUnshown tiles are: [W1: 0; W2: 4; W3: 4; W4: 4; W5: 3; W6: 1; W7: 0; W8: 0; W9: 1; T1: 4; T2: 2; T3: 2; T4: 4; T5: 2; T6: 3; T7: 2; T8: 3; T9: 1; B1: 0; B2: 3; B3: 2; B4: 4; B5: 3; B6: 1; B7: 3; B8: 3; B9: 1; F1: 1; F2: 0; F3: 1; F4: 2; J1: 1; J2: 3; J3: 1].\nYour hand tiles are: [T3: 1; T4: 2; T5: 1; T6: 1; B4: 1; B5: 1; F4: 1].\nYour melds are: [[B1, B1, B1, B1],[B5, B6, B7]].\nThe melds of the next player: [[]].\nThe melds of the player sitting across: [[W1, W1, W1],[T5, T6, T7],[W7, W7, W7]].\nThe melds of the previous player: [[]].\nYour game history is: Play F3, Play W6, Peng B1, Play T2, Play W9, BuGang B1, Play W9, Play W1, Play W1, Play J1, Play W8, Play T7, Play T8, Play F2, Chi B6, Play B8, Play B3.\nThe game history of the next player is: Play F2, Play F3, Play F4, Play F2, Play F1, Play J2, Play T9, Play W8, Play T9, Play T6, Play J3, Play B2, Play W8.\nThe game history of the player sitting across is: Play B6, Play B1, Play T9, Play B9, Play J3, Peng W1, Play J1, Play W8, Play T2, Play B3, Play F4, Chi T6, Play W5, Play W9, Peng W7, Play T5, Play W6, Play B6.\nThe game history of the previous player is: Play F1, Play F3, Play J1, Play B9, Play J3, Play B9, Play W7, Play T3, Play W6, Play F2, Play W7, Play B6, Play F1, Play T3.\nThe followings are your valid actions:[Play B4; Play F4; Play T3; Play T6; Play T5; Play B5; Play T4]\u3002", "reasoning": "", "output": "Evaluation: \u76ee\u524d\u624b\u724c\u4e3a T3 T4T4 T5 T6 + B4 B5 + F4\uff0c\u5df2\u6210\u526f\u9732\uff1aB1\u6760\u3001B567\u5403\u3002\u76ee\u6807\u5e94\u4ee5\u5c3d\u5feb\u505a\u62101\u4e2a\u9762\u5b50+\u5c06\u724c\u4e3a\u4e3b\uff1b\u7af9\u5b50\u90e8\u5206\u6709 T3-6 \u7684\u826f\u597d\u8fde\u5f20\uff0c\u9002\u5408\u505a\u987a\u5b50\uff1b\u70b9\u5b50(B4B5)\u53ea\u662f\u4e00\u642d\u5b50\u4e14 B6 \u4ec5\u52691\u5f20\u3002F4\u4e3a\u5b64\u5f20\u5b57\u724c\u4e14\u4e0d\u5e26\u5f79\uff08\u975e\u573a\u98ce/\u81ea\u98ce\uff09\uff0c\u53ef\u4f5c\u4e3a\u5b89\u5168\u5f03\u724c\u3002  \nReason: \u9009\u62e9\u6253\u51fa F4\uff1a\u4e0d\u7834\u574f\u7af9\u5b50\u6838\u5fc3\u8fdb\u5f20\uff08T3-6 \u53ef\u591a\u79cd\u6210\u987a/\u4e24\u9762\uff09\uff0c\u4e5f\u4e0d\u6d6a\u8d39\u70b9\u5b50\u642d\u5b50\uff1b\u540c\u65f6 F4 \u5728\u684c\u9762\u5df2\u51fa\u73b0\u591a\u5f20\uff08\u4f60\u624b\u91cc1\u5f20\u3001\u5bf9\u5bb6\u6253\u8fc71\u5f20\u3001\u4e0b\u5bb6\u4e5f\u6253\u8fc71\u5f20\uff09\uff0c\u5269\u4f59\u672a\u73b0\u4ec52\u5f20\uff0c\u4fdd\u7559\u4ef7\u503c\u4f4e\uff0c\u5f03\u4e4b\u66f4\u5229\u4e8e\u63d0\u901f\u4e0e\u63a7\u98ce\u9669\u3002  \nAnswer: Play F4"}
